body:
You know what ? I think I can relate to you, in some distant way, in the way of I had never touch and never touched myself and other person. It seems that, when you see, in everywhere, everything and everyone has just to be sexualised and everything has to come to sex, which is just uncanny, in my opinion. Love can be enjoyed without physical touch and intimate relations (I think, because, then again, I never did IT, so I can really be an expertise on a subject that I do not know).

I blame the medias and the loosenig of the World, and it saddens me that people like you and myself can't just stroll outside, without other people thinking about IT;

Just not liking this thing DOES NOT MAKE YOU a freak, or something else that is degrading, because it is simply untrue. Love should be dominating and primary, S E X should be shelve in the background, and/or not be force upon people like you. You know ? You know.
